{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your missing daughter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/472cf7fa735108de950fe81f76ac734b.poster.avif?t=1758960633\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/472cf7fa735108de950fe81f76ac734b.webm?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/472cf7fa735108de950fe81f76ac734b.mp4?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a story-driven, atmospheric horror experience where your main objective is to find your missing daughter, Clare, in a hospital. As you progress, you\u2019ll uncover Clare\u2019s whereabouts and the dark secrets of what happened in the hospital.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/f22b0f1d54dfdcac99f7be8a4024c337.poster.avif?t=1758960633\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/f22b0f1d54dfdcac99f7be8a4024c337.webm?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/f22b0f1d54dfdcac99f7be8a4024c337.mp4?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will need to collect various items such as batteries, ammo, weapons, keys, puzzle parts, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/87011cb59121934cb917218e7d2be874.poster.avif?t=1758960633\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/87011cb59121934cb917218e7d2be874.webm?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/87011cb59121934cb917218e7d2be874.mp4?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to fight some enemies from the hospital to progress. This is why you should search the hospital for ammo and weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avoid the Doctor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/8aa935f6f3c7624f37f2a506782e734a.poster.avif?t=1758960633\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/8aa935f6f3c7624f37f2a506782e734a.webm?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/8aa935f6f3c7624f37f2a506782e734a.mp4?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s one thing in this game you can\u2019t shoot or destroy, the <strong>Doctor\u00a0</strong>himself. Or can you? You\u2019ll have to find out..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/46672d086a1db45499913f7f3e8e119f.poster.avif?t=1758960633\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/46672d086a1db45499913f7f3e8e119f.webm?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/46672d086a1db45499913f7f3e8e119f.mp4?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, to proceed, you will need to find items (like keys) and solve logic puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Publishing plans<br>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to release a demo this year (2024) and the full game next year (2025).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is created by two game developers from Hungary. Driven by passion, we dedicated our free time after long workdays to bring this project to life. If you are interested in the game, you can support us by adding it to your wishlist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seizure warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game may contain flashing lights, images, or patterns that could trigger seizures in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Best experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven horror game designed to immerse you fully in its eerie atmosphere. For the most intense experience, play alone in a dark room with headphones on. Turn off the lights, turn up the volume, and let the fear take over.<br><br>We hope you will enjoy the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3018430?t=1758960633","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758960633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758960633","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758960633","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Be aware of scary moments, assault, blood, corps. "},"demos":[{"appid":3317970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your missing daughter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/472cf7fa735108de950fe81f76ac734b.poster.avif?t=1758960633\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/472cf7fa735108de950fe81f76ac734b.webm?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/472cf7fa735108de950fe81f76ac734b.mp4?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a story-driven, atmospheric horror experience where your main objective is to find your missing daughter, Clare, in a hospital. As you progress, you\u2019ll uncover Clare\u2019s whereabouts and the dark secrets of what happened in the hospital.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/f22b0f1d54dfdcac99f7be8a4024c337.poster.avif?t=1758960633\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/f22b0f1d54dfdcac99f7be8a4024c337.webm?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/f22b0f1d54dfdcac99f7be8a4024c337.mp4?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will need to collect various items such as batteries, ammo, weapons, keys, puzzle parts, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/87011cb59121934cb917218e7d2be874.poster.avif?t=1758960633\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/87011cb59121934cb917218e7d2be874.webm?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/87011cb59121934cb917218e7d2be874.mp4?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to fight some enemies from the hospital to progress. This is why you should search the hospital for ammo and weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avoid the Doctor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/8aa935f6f3c7624f37f2a506782e734a.poster.avif?t=1758960633\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/8aa935f6f3c7624f37f2a506782e734a.webm?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/8aa935f6f3c7624f37f2a506782e734a.mp4?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s one thing in this game you can\u2019t shoot or destroy, the <strong>Doctor\u00a0</strong>himself. Or can you? You\u2019ll have to find out..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/46672d086a1db45499913f7f3e8e119f.poster.avif?t=1758960633\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/46672d086a1db45499913f7f3e8e119f.webm?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/extras/46672d086a1db45499913f7f3e8e119f.mp4?t=1758960633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, to proceed, you will need to find items (like keys) and solve logic puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Publishing plans<br>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to release a demo this year (2024) and the full game next year (2025).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is created by two game developers from Hungary. Driven by passion, we dedicated our free time after long workdays to bring this project to life. If you are interested in the game, you can support us by adding it to your wishlist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seizure warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game may contain flashing lights, images, or patterns that could trigger seizures in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Best experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven horror game designed to immerse you fully in its eerie atmosphere. For the most intense experience, play alone in a dark room with headphones on. Turn off the lights, turn up the volume, and let the fear take over.<br><br>We hope you will enjoy the game!</p>","developers":["V\u00f6r\u00f6s Gergely","Dr.Kupi Marcell"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018430/header.jpg?t=1758960633","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr